{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender PointerRNA.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender PointerRNA.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender pointer rna blender pointer rna","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender PointerRNA.md","fileName":"Blender PointerRNA.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender PointerRNA","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender RNA Data Architecture]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender RNA Data Architecture","Blender StructRNA","Blender Main Database","Blender Operator RNA Properties","Blender Python RNA Bridge","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender PointerRNA.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender PointerRNA.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender pointer rna blender pointer rna","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender PointerRNA.md","fileName":"Blender PointerRNA.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender PointerRNA","heading":"Blender PointerRNA","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"`PointerRNA` associates an actual Blender data address with its [[Blender StructRNA]] description and, when applicable, an owning ID datablock. It is the portable RNA reference passed through runtime APIs rather than exposing an untyped DNA pointer by itself.\n\nThe main-database constructor, for example, pairs a [[Blender Main Database]] pointer with the generated blend-data structure description. [[Blender Operator RNA Properties]] retain their settings through this record, and the [[Blender Python RNA Bridge]] embeds it inside Python-facing objects.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender RNA Data Architecture","Blender StructRNA","Blender Main Database","Blender Operator RNA Properties","Blender Python RNA Bridge","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"pr